{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が食べた名古屋名物は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きしめん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日連続食べました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きしめんずっと食べたいと言ってたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ先週の個別で名古屋来たときも\n食べたんだけどね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね\n差し入れでいただいた\n弁天堂の栗粉餅！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈の好きなやつね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち帰ったのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自動車もなかと名古屋ふらんす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べるの楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、\nまだライブのセトリとかは言えないとは言え\nさすがにライブの話もしとこう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、\nサプライズ発表がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13thシングルが\n10月28日に発売決定！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別は8月13日から\nforTUNE musicで受付開始しますよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という内容でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、\n愛知 3公演ありましたが\n来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に暑かった！\n汗が尋常じゃなかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の事を見てくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\n今日は寧々が来てくれてたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に会えて嬉しかった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の全国ツアーの愛知Tシャツを着て\nリハしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の宮城の時も\n去年の宮城Tシャツ着てたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の広島は\n初めての場所だからTシャツ無いんだけどね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島楽しみだな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/09/2543481/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方泊まるとき\nテレビでローカルのＣＭ見るの\n結構楽しみなんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前\n2日連続名古屋で握手会だったから\n名古屋で泊まりだったのね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明治村っていう愛知の博物館で\n『赤ゲットの幽霊』っていう\nお化け屋敷のＣＭしてて\n行ってみたいと思った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期間限定だけど\nいつか行けるかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}